{"id":"dd42e4c43322822e","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-countable-back-and-forth.md","title":"Countable Back-and-Forth Isomorphism Criterion","display":"thm-countable-back-and-forth — Countable Back-and-Forth Isomorphism Criterion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-countable-back-and-forth","aliases":["17-thm-countable-back-and-forth"],"display":"thm-countable-back-and-forth — Countable Back-and-Forth Isomorphism Criterion","depends_on":["[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]","[[17-df-isomorphism]]","[[17-df-set-functions]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-5.3.1b","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-countable-back-and-forth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-countable-back-and-forth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-countable-back-and-forth — Countable Back-and-Forth Isomorphism Criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f21d04ffa9b76787\" href=\"?note=f21d04ffa9b76787\" title=\"17-df-partial-isomorphism\">17-df-partial-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-5.3.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak A|\\times|\\mathfrak B|)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak A|\\times|\\mathfrak B|)\\)</span> 是候选部分映射族。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartIso}\">\\(\\operatorname{PartIso}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong\">\\(\\cong\\)</span> (partial isomorphism and isomorphism, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f21d04ffa9b76787\" href=\"?note=f21d04ffa9b76787\" title=\"17-df-partial-isomorphism\">17-df-partial-isomorphism</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f3187e8ff79e64e\" href=\"?note=9f3187e8ff79e64e\" title=\"17-df-isomorphism\">17-df-isomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> (domain and range, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|\">\\(|\\cdot|\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> (cardinality and least infinite cardinal, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak B|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal F\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(p))\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;\n\\exists q\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(p\\subseteq q\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q))\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall b\\in|\\mathfrak B|\\;\n\\exists q\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(p\\subseteq q\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(q))\n\\Bigr]\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\n\\land\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak A|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak B|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\n\\varnothing\\neq\\mathcal F\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(p))\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\;\n\\exists q\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(p\\subseteq q\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q))\n\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\n\\forall b\\in|\\mathfrak B|\\;\n\\exists q\\in\\mathcal F\\;\n(p\\subseteq q\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(q))\n\\Bigr]\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enumerating the two countable carriers and alternating the two extension clauses produces a total bijective partial isomorphism. The family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> is expanded locally because no reusable back-and-forth predicate is needed elsewhere.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f21d04ffa9b76787","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f3187e8ff79e64e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ (class of $L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f21d04ffa9b76787","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{PartIso}$ and $\\cong$ (partial isomorphism and isomorphism, see [[17-df-partial-isomorphism]] and [[17-df-isomorphism]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f3187e8ff79e64e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","he